cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: Shipment Document Control
abstract: "Checks a shipment's document pack against the shipping instruction on a SharePoint list, gets the drafts approved by a named person, then chases the originals via Outlook. Presence by set arithmetic, agreement by fixed rules, a language model only where the reading is. Runs on self-hosted n8n."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sidorecs
    given-names: Aleks
repository-code: "https://github.com/automatiqa-lab/ship-doc"
license: MIT
keywords:
